From 78c8597ccb66cb6e0658bf30f257b79482984867 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:41:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] expert_pack: SSD-LLaMA three-tier host (RAM) expert cache
 and paper VRAM admission policy

Unified design: pinned, aligned RAM-cache slots double as the SSD read pool;
lookup order VRAM -> RAM -> SSD; transient VRAM slots for cold experts;
(access_count, last_access) eviction with demotion to RAM; RAM LRU with
in-flight protection. host_cache_mib=0 + vram_admission_policy=lru keeps the
original acquire() code path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
